WEBVTT

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.536
JF: She doesn't invite me over much,
I'll tell you that.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.576
LT: I have to use a lot of social media --

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.096
You be quiet now. And so --

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:36.416
(Laughter)

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:39.456
LT: And I look through my emails,
I look through my texts

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:40.696
to find my friends,

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.816
so I can answer them
as quickly as possible,

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:45.256
because I know they need my counsel.

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:48.056
(Laughter)

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.336
They need my support,

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.456
because most of my friends
are writers, or activists, or actors,

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:53.776
and you're all three ...

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:57.416
and a long string
of other descriptive phrases,

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:01.736
and I want to get to you
as soon as possible,